ael scolds Laila on not doing her duties. Nanael tells her that what Laila has done are just small acts of kindness, and tells her that when her actions make Nanael look bad. However, Nanael makes Laila summon a great weapon to exterminate evil, so that Laila can score extra points on the upcoming assessment.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87491/4892636.jpg"},{"title":"Exposed as I Push the Limits!? Vol. 1: Special Training! Annelotte's Holy Poses","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9513","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16363","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16363","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45502","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[31]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87491","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[31]}],"link":"20859","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Exposed as I Push the Limits!? Vol. 1: Special Training! Annelotte's Holy Poses","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Leina battles Liliana in a Sacred Duel which is disrupted by the Swamp Witch. Leina is captured and tortured into almost hopelessness. Liliana is angry at the Swamp Witch's interference in the Sacred Duel and gives Leina the means to fight back. Leina succeeds and manages to free herself but she is now cursed to sleep during the day. This explains her appearance in Queen's Blade Rebellion (Season 3) and why she can't help her people more.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87491/4914221.jpg"},{"title":"Exposed as I Push the Limits!? Vol. 2: Vibrations! Mirim Gets Undressed","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9513","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16363","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16363","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45502","scope